{"id":"rodnye","lemma":"родные","pos":"noun","rank":3782,"glosses":["relatives, kinsfolk, kin, the loved ones"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/67/Ru-%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"родных","plural":"родные"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы не родные братья, а двоюродные.","en":"We're not brothers. We're cousins.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"brother","l":"брат"},{"g":"and / but"},{"g":"denotes a relative in…","l":"двоюродный"}]},{"text":"У меня нет родных братьев.","en":"I don't have any brothers.","words":[{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null,{"g":"brother","l":"брат"}]},{"text":"Где родные Тома?","en":"Where's Tom's family?","words":[{"g":"where"},null,{"g":"volume","l":"том"}]},{"text":"Я могу взять отгул на несколько дней, чтобы навестить родных?","en":"May I take a few days off to visit my family?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"paid time off in…"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"somewhat"},{"g":"day, daytime","l":"день"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"to visit"},null]},{"text":"Том и Джон женаты на родных сёстрах.","en":"Tom and John are married to sisters.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"and"},null,null,{"g":"on / at"},null,null]}]}